{
  "lemmas": [
    {
      "lemma": "property lemma_1; @(posedge clock) disable iff (rst) ((I679 || I680 || I681) |-> qShiftRight); endproperty",
      "explanation": "This invariant holds after reset. With all three flags clear, an update can raise only I681, through I744; the same update sets qShiftRight to I744. Once a flag is raised, ShiftRight and qShiftRight are both high, so mShiftRight is high in either TESTMODE and the flag/control update branch is skipped. At the transition that first raises I681, I744 also forces qINSo[2:1] to 2'b10. The controls then remain unchanged, making the target property 1-inductive with this lemma."
    }
  ]
}
</json>
